Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.30,0:02:04.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《新·大雄的大魔境》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.62,0:03:26.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很久以前
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.48,0:03:29.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球上充满着各种谜团与神秘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.32,0:03:36.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永无止尽蔓延开来的茂密丛林
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.80,0:03:40.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高耸穿越云层的白色巨大山峰
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.13,0:03:46.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被寒冰封闭起来的死亡世界
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.18,0:03:50.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些现在有什么改变呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.86,0:03:52.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是丛林或沙漠
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.66,0:03:54.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪地里或高山上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.38,0:03:56.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至连深海的海底也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.65,0:03:57.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球上的每个角落
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.88,0:03:59.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都已经被人探险过了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.05,0:04:00.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.72,0:04:03.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经没有人类无法到达的地方了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.59,0:04:09.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这实在太过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.76,0:04:11.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然连一点点谜团
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.03,0:04:12.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或是没有被破解的神秘事件
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.60,0:04:14.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都没有留给我们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.32,0:04:16.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你 你对我发脾气也没有用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.13,0:04:18.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.67,0:04:20.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我才找你们来商量啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.96,0:04:22.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球这么的辽阔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.64,0:04:23.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信一定还有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.68,0:04:26.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没被人发现的魔境或神秘地点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.91,0:04:28.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 只要拜托哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.92,0:04:30.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该就能找到这样的地方了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.32,0:04:32.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.80,0:04:34.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以说今年暑假
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.52,0:04:36.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一起去魔境旅行探险吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.35,0:04:39.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好主意 就这么决定了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.49,0:04:40.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.76,0:04:43.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 听到了没大雄 - 听懂了没大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.78,0:04:43.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.86,0:04:47.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.30,0:04:49.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们怎么可以随便决定这种事情呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.86,0:04:53.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托 哆啦A梦 帮我找到魔境嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.87,0:04:55.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然我一定会被胖虎揍扁的…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.00,0:04:57.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是个未来机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.42,0:04:59.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重复一次 我只是个…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.32,0:05:02.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求求你嘛 万能的哆啦大明神…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.86,0:05:04.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要白费力气了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.72,0:05:05.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.58,0:05:07.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从天涯到海角的每个角落
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.18,0:05:08.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都被人类探险过了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.36,0:05:08.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.35,0:05:11.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也说不定…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.00,0:05:14.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我们再努力找找看…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.56,0:05:18.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就算躲起来也没有用啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.53,0:05:21.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很烦耶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.55,0:05:25.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点出来…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.06,0:05:27.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暂停一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.42,0:05:29.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.06,0:05:30.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是去年要买铜锣烧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.28,0:05:31.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却弄丢的一百圆硬币
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.98,0:05:33.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本来都已经放弃了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.25,0:05:35.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是意外的小确幸啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.88,0:05:37.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点去买铜锣烧吃啰
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.32,0:05:39.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.33,0:05:41.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要不轻言放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.62,0:05:43.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再彻底找找看的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.38,0:05:44.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许就会找到
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.25,0:05:46.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没被人发现过的魔境啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.66,0:05:51.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彻底找找看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:55.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三…二…一
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.16,0:05:58.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,私人卫星发射
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.62,0:06:07.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个人造卫星
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.86,0:06:10.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它会把地球的照片传送回来对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.08,0:06:11.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.92,0:06:15.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么快就传回来了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.52,0:06:19.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拍得好清楚哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.03,0:06:21.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了这些照片
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.26,0:06:22.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一定能找到魔境对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.70,0:06:23.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太天真了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.50,0:06:26.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要把地球每个角落都拍摄出来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.70,0:06:28.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能要拍好几万张 不对…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.90,0:06:31.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定要拍好几百万张照片哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.60,0:06:32.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好几百万张
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.96,0:06:34.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要看完所有照片
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.22,0:06:35.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道要花上几天
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.68,0:06:37.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几个礼拜或是几个月
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.10,0:06:40.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且说不定到头来什么都没有找到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.04,0:06:44.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都还没试过 不要说这种丧气的话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.35,0:06:47.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算只有我一个人也要做给你看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.56,0:06:49.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.12,0:06:52.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就真的这么怕胖虎吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.43,0:06:53.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也是原因之一
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.38,0:06:55.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也觉得很有趣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.10,0:06:57.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果真的能发现大魔境
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.92,0:07:00.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还能去探险的话 不是很酷吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.78,0:07:02.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算要耗掉一整个暑假
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.43,0:07:04.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也觉得有试试的价值
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.03,0:07:06.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.10,0:07:08.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然你已经下定决心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.72,0:07:10.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就助你一臂之力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.35,0:07:11.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.38,0:07:13.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你果然是最可靠的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.15,0:07:15.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.92,0:07:17.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要修正一下卫星的轨道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.20,0:07:20.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先把海洋和都市排除
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.22,0:07:21.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去探索远离文明社会
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.95,0:07:23.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人烟稀少的区域
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.89,0:07:25.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原始丛林 高山地区
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.96,0:07:28.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或是沙漠之类的比较有机会
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.29,0:07:31.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就先锁定非洲地区来找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.66,0:07:33.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是个好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.27,0:07:37.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 已经把卫星从印度洋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.35,0:07:38.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,移动到非洲上空了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.14,0:07:41.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进入大西洋之后 再改变纬度
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.64,0:07:43.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反复跨越非洲大陆进行探索吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.82,0:07:46.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始 摄影
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.85,0:07:53.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害 是丛林耶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.70,0:07:55.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是一直在丛林里漫无目地的寻找
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.92,0:07:57.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也没什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.19,0:07:58.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最好可以设定一个目标
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.92,0:08:00.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从没被人发现过的湖泊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.69,0:08:02.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或古代遗迹之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.26,0:08:04.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我一定要找到才行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.98,0:08:05.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.20,0:08:08.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.40,0:08:11.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以帮我去买个东西回来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.66,0:08:15.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次有事要忙 就会叫我去跑腿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.60,0:08:27.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那只小狗怎么了 全身脏兮兮的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.70,0:08:37.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.56,0:08:38.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.48,0:08:40.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我们家不准养狗啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.06,0:08:43.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.93,0:08:45.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的饿到都站不起来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.01,0:08:52.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然你真的很可怜…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.92,0:08:55.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我实在没办法帮你做什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.72,0:09:02.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢惠顾 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.35,0:09:03.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.85,0:09:09.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还要…买一些热狗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.52,0:09:12.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请给我最便宜的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.80,0:09:28.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点吃吧 你不是饿扁了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.76,0:09:30.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来喂你吃香肠吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.95,0:09:33.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是先说好 你不可以跟我回家哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.85,0:09:36.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 一言为定哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.23,0:09:43.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 等一下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.62,0:09:52.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.25,0:10:02.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然脏兮兮的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.91,0:10:03.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过仔细一看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.02,0:10:05.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是一只长得很漂亮的狗呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.56,0:10:09.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经没有时间在这里摸鱼了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.96,0:10:12.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得赶快回家调查非洲
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.22,0:10:14.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见啰
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.20,0:10:17.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你可以被好心人收养
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.58,0:10:24.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,累积这么多啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.13,0:10:27.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为数量太多来不及看完
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.60,0:10:28.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我就先暂时停止
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.91,0:10:29.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回传这些照片了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.90,0:10:33.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我要开始仔细检查照片了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.85,0:10:37.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我叫的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.50,0:10:39.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该不会是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.25,0:10:44.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才不是都跟你说好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.12,0:10:46.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么可以跟着我回来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.66,0:10:48.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你把狗狗带回来的吗 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.85,0:10:50.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我带回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.10,0:10:51.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是它自己跟我回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.72,0:10:52.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.50,0:10:54.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是被妈妈发现就惨了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.54,0:10:55.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.66,0:10:57.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.26,0:10:58.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点藏起来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.43,0:10:59.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以发出声音喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.72,0:11:03.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有件事情 我想问你们两个一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.48,0:11:08.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对…对不起 是它自己跟我回家的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.15,0:11:09.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我马上就把它赶出去 - 阿弥陀佛…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.40,0:11:10.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.80,0:11:12.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别再说这些我听不懂的话了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.32,0:11:13.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是要问你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.22,0:11:15.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有看到一个像这样大小的皮包
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.68,0:11:16.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮包
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.70,0:11:18.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吓我一大跳
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.02,0:11:21.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有看到妈妈的皮包啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.52,0:11:23.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是刚才从银行回来的路上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.48,0:11:24.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弄丢了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.63,0:11:27.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们家全部的财产都在里面啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.30,0:11:28.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.48,0:11:29.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请您振作一点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.88,0:11:31.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们赶快去找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.86,0:11:39.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你从银行出来以后
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.16,0:11:40.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就直接走回家了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.43,0:11:42.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不太记得耶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.10,0:11:44.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天气热得我头昏眼花
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.65,0:11:45.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经记不清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.12,0:11:50.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么也跟来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.58,0:11:52.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它好像闻到什么东西了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.40,0:11:54.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是我们家的方向耶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.88,0:11:56.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总而言之 先跟过去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.78,0:11:57.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那只狗狗怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.96,0:12:00.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(松饼 本日推荐 圣代)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.95,0:12:01.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.20,0:12:03.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 我想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.20,0:12:05.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为天气太热
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.48,0:12:07.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跑来这里吃红豆汤圆冰啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.06,0:12:09.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次都偷吃
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.83,0:12:11.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偶尔一次 偶尔一次嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.93,0:12:14.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狗狗突然跑到巷子里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.86,0:12:16.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.26,0:12:19.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才因为这里发生了火灾
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.28,0:12:21.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这附近挤满了围观的民众
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.62,0:12:23.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果我就被推到旁边 重心不稳…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.02,0:12:26.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我就在这里跌倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.42,0:12:31.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到 找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.58,0:12:34.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里有我们家全部的财产
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.16,0:12:39.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 有件事我想跟你商量
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.36,0:12:41.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这只狗狗是只可怜的流浪狗…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.33,0:12:44.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可不可以收养它
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.48,0:12:45.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来报答这份恩情
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.68,0:12:51.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.80,0:12:53.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像在做梦一样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.20,0:12:54.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们家竟然可以
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.10,0:12:56.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光明正大的养狗狗了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.12,0:12:58.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看 这里有贴壁狗屋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.38,0:13:02.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就是你的家了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.40,0:13:09.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好宽敞哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.16,0:13:10.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它好像蛮喜欢的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.12,0:13:13.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 要给它取什么名字呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.50,0:13:16.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它的肚子一直饿扁扁的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.61,0:13:17.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就叫它扁扁吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.78,0:13:18.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.48,0:13:25.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变得好干净哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.16,0:13:27.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好白哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.06,0:13:38.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.30,0:13:48.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 你回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.02,0:13:49.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.32,0:13:51.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这只小狗是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.45,0:13:52.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从今天开始
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.63,0:13:54.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它就是我们家的狗狗啰
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.13,0:13:55.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 我叫扁扁
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.70,0:13:57.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.23,0:14:00.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然很可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.43,0:14:02.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是把它放回去原来的地方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.16,0:14:03.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.23,0:14:05.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还问为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.48,0:14:07.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为妈妈一定不会答应的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:08.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老公
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.58,0:14:09.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.35,0:14:11.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道你要对这只可怜的狗狗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.18,0:14:12.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见死不救吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.88,0:14:14.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.52,0:14:16.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你觉得可以收养它就没问题啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.73,0:14:19.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.02,0:14:27.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这条河的上游
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.46,0:14:28.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,据说有一个连野兽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.58,0:14:30.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不敢靠近的大魔境
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.36,0:14:31.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里有个
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.11,0:14:33.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,曾在遥远古代繁荣过的日月之都
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.45,0:14:35.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好酷哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.23,0:14:38.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管路途上会遇到多少困难
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.58,0:14:39.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们大雄探险队
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.08,0:14:42.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都要同心协力克服难关才行哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.40,0:14:48.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.26,0:14:49.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,河水里好像有什么东西耶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.32,0:14:52.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家要小心防范哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.88,0:15:00.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…是怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.08,0:15:05.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎各位 光临我们的非洲乐园
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.66,0:15:07.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.32,0:15:12.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,充满秘境风情 气氛紧张刺激
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.26,0:15:14.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从小朋友到老人家 都可以安全享受的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.73,0:15:15.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冒险游乐园
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.15,0:15:18.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎来到非洲乐园
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.36,0:15:24.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 这算哪门子的魔境啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.98,0:15:26.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你竟敢欺骗我们
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.66,0:15:28.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下啦 我也不知道会这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.17,0:15:30.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少啰嗦 不要跑
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.38,0:15:31.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.13,0:15:37.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔境已经不存在了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.50,0:15:46.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是做梦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.52,0:15:50.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是说不定梦里说的是真话耶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.02,0:15:53.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么魔境根本已经不存在了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.13,0:15:56.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扁扁
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.52,0:16:01.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是怎么想的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.13,0:16:04.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得魔境真的存在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.86,0:16:07.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说得也是 一定存在对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.12,0:16:10.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天跟我一起睡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.32,0:16:12.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安啰
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.26,0:16:33.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃早餐啰 快起床吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.08,0:16:42.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扁扁 吃饭的地方在那边哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.28,0:16:51.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要开动啰…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.73,0:16:55.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.72,0:16:56.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.86,0:17:02.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 我说你的吃相也太难看了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.96,0:17:04.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得多跟扁扁学习才行哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.16,0:17:11.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好有教养的狗狗哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.63,0:17:14.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦脸上有饭粒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.05,0:17:22.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出现稀树草原的照片了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.02,0:17:24.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稀树草原是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.69,0:17:26.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是一种草原地形啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.36,0:17:28.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大多分布在东非洲地区
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.68,0:17:29.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道有没有猛兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.03,0:17:31.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该会有吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.62,0:17:32.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好酷哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.80,0:17:34.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 光是在非洲地区
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.97,0:17:36.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差不多会拍出几张照片
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.80,0:17:38.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一张照片平均来说
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.16,0:17:40.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大约是三平方公里…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.40,0:17:42.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以差不多会有九百三十万张吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.86,0:17:45.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九百三十万张
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.86,0:17:51.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你振作一点啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.10,0:17:53.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是早就已经做好心理准备了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.12,0:17:56.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 你快点来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.06,0:18:06.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.00,0:18:09.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我居然昏倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.60,0:18:12.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要再加紧速度调查才行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.90,0:18:14.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然寒假都要到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.47,0:18:16.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要太勉强自己比较好哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.98,0:18:23.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.32,0:18:26.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明明已经停止传送照片了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.48,0:18:29.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 扁扁 - 吓我一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.82,0:18:29.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.25,0:18:32.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是扁扁在捣蛋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.49,0:18:34.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弄得乱七八糟的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.50,0:18:39.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.95,0:18:43.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丛林中心有块空地
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.10,0:18:46.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把这个区域放大出来看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.43,0:18:50.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会是岩石吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.26,0:18:53.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对 一定是人造的东西啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.91,0:18:55.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个时候就需要…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.78,0:18:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,六面照相机
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.65,0:18:59.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 快点拿着这张照片
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.26,0:19:00.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,面对我这里 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.38,0:19:03.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.36,0:19:04.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保持这样 不要乱动
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.33,0:19:09.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.33,0:19:14.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是石像耶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.83,0:19:16.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且是在茂密丛林的深处
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.10,0:19:18.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去问问小杉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.28,0:19:19.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他的知识比较渊博
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.88,0:19:21.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快吃晚餐了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.23,0:19:21.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待会吃
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.28,0:19:27.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还是第一次看到这个
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.56,0:19:29.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是在非洲的哪个区域
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.11,0:19:32.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在非洲中部的…丛林深处里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.32,0:19:34.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非洲中部是吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.70,0:19:39.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就有可能是老烟枪丛林
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.99,0:19:41.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说老烟枪丛林
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.92,0:19:42.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.28,0:19:46.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,字面上的意思 就是喜欢抽烟的森林
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.30,0:19:48.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在非洲中部的某一部分丛林
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.56,0:19:50.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为上空长年被云层覆盖着
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.86,0:19:52.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以有些地区卫星是拍不到的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.80,0:19:54.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.03,0:19:57.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我的卫星不会受到云层的影响嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.15,0:19:59.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你的帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.98,0:20:01.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.88,0:20:05.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于…我们终于找到魔境了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.42,0:20:07.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要赶快通知大家
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.75,0:20:09.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天一大早就出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.53,0:20:11.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的好期待喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.62,0:20:21.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道大家到齐了没有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.40,0:20:27.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么帽子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.20,0:20:30.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像这样才会有探险的气氛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.46,0:20:33.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太慢了啦大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.42,0:20:34.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.92,0:20:36.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这只小狗从哪里来的 - 好可爱哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.58,0:20:36.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.18,0:20:40.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它叫做扁扁 我在这里捡到的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.66,0:20:42.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你哦 扁扁
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.72,0:20:46.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来是一只很聪明的狗哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.30,0:20:48.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.59,0:20:50.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点也不像它的主人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.08,0:20:52.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.36,0:20:54.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本来就是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.55,0:21:01.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,探险队 整队 报数
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.02,0:21:02.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.50,0:21:02.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.97,0:21:03.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.57,0:21:04.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.17,0:21:04.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.03,0:21:05.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.93,0:21:07.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不是明明只有四个人而已吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.66,0:21:09.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好奇怪哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.03,0:21:12.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚刚确实听到有人喊五耶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.53,0:21:14.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎你真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.28,0:21:17.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你忘记把自己算进去了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.90,0:21:21.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对哦 加上我就五个人了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.88,0:21:24.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 有请哆啦队员
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.48,0:21:26.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为大家说明这次探险的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.82,0:21:27.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.98,0:21:29.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任意门
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.40,0:21:32.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次我们要去的地方是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.12,0:21:35.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孕育出最古老人类的土地
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.15,0:21:36.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是所谓的非洲大陆
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.16,0:21:39.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从太古时代
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.40,0:21:42.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就从未放晴被迷雾笼罩的丛林深处
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.35,0:21:44.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,矗立着神秘的巨人石像
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.23,0:21:44.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请问一下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.08,0:21:47.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里会不会也有什么宝藏呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.10,0:21:50.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要妄想宝藏什么的无聊事情了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.72,0:21:52.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们真正的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.10,0:21:56.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是要体验既紧张又刺激的大冒险
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.03,0:21:58.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为马上抵达目的地的话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.70,0:21:59.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就太没有意思了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.33,0:22:01.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以留一百公里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.50,0:22:03.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靠自己的双脚去探险吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.97,0:22:06.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朝距离目标一百公里处移动
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.96,0:22:10.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 你们都准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.20,0:22:12.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然啰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.88,0:22:13.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.82,0:22:15.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.38,0:22:20.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 大冒险即将展开啰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.13,0:22:22.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走了…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.46,0:22:23.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.80,0:22:29.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好重哦 - 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.36,0:22:29.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.58,0:22:30.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你在搞什么 - 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.78,0:22:30.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.79,0:22:31.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛哦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.40,0:22:52.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好壮观哦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.13,0:22:58.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是非洲
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.23,0:23:01.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们大家 来到真正的非洲了对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.16,0:23:10.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扁扁说要我们快点出发啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.92,0:23:11.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.88,0:23:13.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们快点走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.10,0:23:17.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,探险队 出发啰
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.78,0:23:23.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.32,0:23:31.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好稀奇的花哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.20,0:23:39.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欧卡皮鹿
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.28,0:23:43.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是母子耶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.03,0:23:49.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发型好酷哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.66,0:23:51.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.26,0:24:23.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要拍啰
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.60,0:24:28.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 快点跳啦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.88,0:24:29.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好开心哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.98,0:24:30.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.86,0:24:32.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管玩几天都不会腻呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.38,0:24:40.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我腻了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.90,0:24:44.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差不多已经走了十公里了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.06,0:24:47.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该只走了五公里而已吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.52,0:24:50.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有九十五公里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.86,0:24:52.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在丛林里不管走到哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.58,0:24:53.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都只有树木而已
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.22,0:24:55.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也是理所当然的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.73,0:24:58.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么连一只猛兽也没看见
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.63,0:25:01.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本连一点紧张刺激的感觉都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.10,0:25:05.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这些人太多抱怨了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.72,0:25:06.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看扁扁
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.78,0:25:08.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么努力地勇往直前
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.30,0:25:09.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要多向他学习才行
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.18,0:25:12.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我忘记做很重要的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.40,0:25:14.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.22,0:25:15.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点把任意门拿出来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.98,0:25:17.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要做什么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.13,0:25:18.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我忘记把零分的考卷藏起来
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.03,0:25:20.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要回去藏好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.78,0:25:25.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,探险的气氛都被你破坏掉了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.90,0:25:27.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我马上就回来哦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.83,0:25:33.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.78,0:25:35.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好还没有被妈妈发现
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.60,0:25:38.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要去哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.86,0:25:39.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去非洲
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.06,0:25:41.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得在吃晚饭前回来哦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.43,0:25:46.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去非洲
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.78,0:25:48.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了各位 别再分心了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.66,0:25:49.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续前进
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.08,0:25:51.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好意思这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.10,0:25:54.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.66,0:25:56.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我忘记设定预约录像
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.10,0:25:58.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天的高阶法语教学节目了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.77,0:26:00.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我马上就回来哦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.40,0:26:01.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们实在太超过了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.86,0:26:05.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全没有身为探险队一员的自觉嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.36,0:26:08.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧…各位
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.05,0:26:11.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们重新振作再出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.43,0:26:15.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.95,0:26:17.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以把任意门借我用一下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.82,0:26:20.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连静香也要吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.39,0:26:21.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.09,0:26:25.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不准你们再随随便便用任意门了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.58,0:26:28.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可…可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.78,0:26:30.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想上洗手间
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.86,0:26:35.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从来没有听过中途还跑回家
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.66,0:26:37.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上厕所的探险队啦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.72,0:26:39.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.73,0:26:40.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次如果还有人说
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.85,0:26:42.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中途要离队回家的话
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.53,0:26:44.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本大爷一定会揍扁他的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.52,0:26:46.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管什么理由都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.05,0:26:49.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 我告诉你…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.36,0:26:50.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.96,0:26:54.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么…你说我老妈她…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.28,0:26:57.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,气得火冒三丈 要我回家…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.48,0:27:00.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.56,0:27:02.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以向你借一下任意门吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.17,0:27:04.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从来没听过还要中途跑回家…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.96,0:27:06.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找妈妈的探险队呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.88,0:27:08.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少啰嗦 少啰嗦
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.06,0:27:21.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.63,0:27:30.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始觉得有点累了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.63,0:27:33.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有扁扁看起来还很有精神
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.73,0:27:39.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个…差不多该吃午饭了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.02,0:27:40.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.60,0:27:43.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我没带便当过来耶
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.76,0:27:45.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系 交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.28,0:27:47.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外送电话
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.63,0:27:50.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以 如果你用这种东西的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.93,0:27:52.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让您久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.43,0:27:54.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说得也是 把气氛都破坏掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.32,0:27:57.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那用这个吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.63,0:28:00.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,植物改造剂I
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.96,0:28:04.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 说说看你们想吃什么东西吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.46,0:28:05.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要咖哩饭
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.36,0:28:06.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想吃松饼
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.10,0:28:07.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,螃蟹炒饭
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.18,0:28:07.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拉面
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.55,0:28:09.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看哦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.88,0:28:13.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咖哩饭的注射剂在哪里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.23,0:28:15.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.70,0:28:19.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就用这棵树
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.21,0:28:27.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等到开出花朵 结出果实以后
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.35,0:28:32.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要的咖哩饭就完成啰
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.22,0:28:33.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.38,0:28:36.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是这个一点也不像是咖哩饭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.20,0:28:38.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你先打开看看嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.70,0:28:42.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.20,0:28:48.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,预备…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.93,0:28:51.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好香哦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.30,0:28:52.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好酷哦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.46,0:28:53.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然要用餐
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.42,0:28:55.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就找个风景优美的地方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.80,0:28:57.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上搭电梯
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.56,0:29:05.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这棵树的顶端做个餐厅吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.72,0:29:11.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,植物改造剂II
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.60,0:29:27.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 一个一个坐上来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.50,0:29:31.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要第一个
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.38,0:29:32.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那我第二个 - 扁扁
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.85,0:29:32.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.32,0:29:34.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 准备吃饭啰
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.48,0:29:38.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扁扁也肚子饿了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.92,0:29:40.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别掉下去哦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.20,0:29:50.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好酷哦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.90,0:29:52.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮的景色哦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.20,0:29:54.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要开动啰…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.38,0:30:07.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在丛林里一起吃午餐真是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.08,0:30:10.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还能让胖虎消气真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.92,0:30:18.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,炒饭也分我吃一口啦
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.93,0:30:21.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 扁扁
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.52,0:30:23.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么地方
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.88,0:30:27.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,北方有一团好像白色烟雾的东西哦
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.62,0:30:31.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那…那该不会就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.81,0:30:33.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是老烟枪丛林…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.28,0:30:36.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来传说是真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.30,0:30:38.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只要继续前进就能到达了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.76,0:30:39.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.52,0:30:49.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,气氛都炒热起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.45,0:30:51.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在只差猛兽还没有出现而已
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.76,0:30:53.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不然就有探险的感觉了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.50,0:30:56.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 你可以变出猛兽吗
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.92,0:30:58.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这当然没问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.08,0:31:01.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,招兽披风
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.80,0:31:04.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从披风发出的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.38,0:31:06.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会让猛兽变得非常生气
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.51,0:31:07.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且把它们吸引过来哦
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.42,0:31:16.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扁扁 你在叫什么
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.78,0:31:22.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一直汪汪叫我听不懂啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.86,0:31:29.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是花豹
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.50,0:31:32.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救…救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.43,0:31:46.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种时候要用桃太郎丸子
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.63,0:31:48.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.10,0:31:52.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,驯服以后变得好可爱哦
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.23,0:31:53.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要骑 我也要
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.92,0:31:56.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁叫你们多管闲事的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.03,0:31:59.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本大爷本来想要大显身手收服它的说
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.18,0:32:02.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.40,0:32:03.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又在逞强了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.73,0:32:05.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说真的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.76,0:32:09.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本来想像这样拿起这根大木棍
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.82,0:32:12.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动作敏捷地把它打昏…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.38,0:32:20.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对…对不起 对不起啦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.62,0:32:24.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕了 缩小灯
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.68,0:32:25.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我试试看好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.56,0:32:27.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.08,0:32:28.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.46,0:32:34.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看 已经不可怕了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.53,0:32:35.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变得像蚯蚓了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.26,0:32:40.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快把我变回来
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.78,0:32:46.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是犀牛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.10,0:32:51.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么…每只…都要找我…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.42,0:32:54.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冲击枪
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.48,0:32:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次换我来试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.13,0:32:59.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,饶了我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.30,0:33:03.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看招
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.59,0:33:05.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.36,0:33:08.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.42,0:33:10.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太精彩了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.38,0:33:11.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真了不起耶
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.22,0:33:13.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.66,0:33:17.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.08,0:33:19.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次又换成大猩猩在追着他跑耶
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.58,0:33:21.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来好像兄弟吵架
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.16,0:33:22.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超人手套
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.33,0:33:25.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香 这次要试试看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.48,0:33:27.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是人家没有把握耶
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.52,0:33:28.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.46,0:33:34.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大猩猩先生 你要对付的人是我
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.82,0:33:50.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.26,0:33:53.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.38,0:34:04.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎你回来
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.03,0:34:10.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是对不起哦 大猩猩先生
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.83,0:34:12.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好厉害哦 静香
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.53,0:34:14.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本是女泰山嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.18,0:34:21.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.06,0:34:23.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太好玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.40,0:34:25.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从来都没有过这种经验耶
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.78,0:34:27.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是所谓的探险啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.82,0:34:32.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这算什么探险嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.12,0:34:35.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这算什么非洲嘛 无聊死了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.28,0:34:38.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再也不想玩这种无聊游戏了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.96,0:34:41.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 巨神像的谜团还没解开…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.40,0:34:43.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过就是一座石头神像而已嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.32,0:34:45.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果再有人敢说
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.62,0:34:47.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去什么魔境探险的话
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.33,0:34:49.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本大爷就马上把他揍扁
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.08,0:34:51.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也太霸道了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.53,0:34:52.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系啦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.86,0:34:55.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正今天已经开心玩了一整天了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.83,0:34:57.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说得也是 小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.05,0:34:59.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.05,0:35:16.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快醒来…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.58,0:35:20.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快醒来吧 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.18,0:35:27.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我听错了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.30,0:35:35.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…是巨神像
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.95,0:35:39.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这…这怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.00,0:35:42.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己说要去魔境探险
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.20,0:35:45.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果你最后却又随便说放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.68,0:35:48.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样也算是男子汉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.29,0:35:51.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为…我觉得很无聊嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.19,0:35:54.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这件事情一点也不无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.63,0:35:56.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且去了也不会有损失
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.30,0:35:58.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到时候
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.37,0:36:01.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定可以亲眼目睹神秘的景象
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.50,0:36:02.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神秘的景象
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.22,0:36:05.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧 勇敢的少年
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.43,0:36:10.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用你的双手取得巴邬刚的财宝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.70,0:36:11.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神明大人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.60,0:36:22.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴邬刚
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.32,0:36:26.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴邬刚的财宝…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.90,0:36:28.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.92,0:36:31.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神秘的巨神像出现在我的房间里
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.43,0:36:32.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后就把那张藏宝图
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.82,0:36:34.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给了本大爷
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.83,0:36:36.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是非洲的神明吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.56,0:36:38.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是用签字笔画在牛皮纸上的地图耶
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.07,0:36:40.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉有点可疑
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.70,0:36:42.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是说不想再去探险了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.11,0:36:44.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己说要去魔境探险
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.56,0:36:45.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又随便说要放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.92,0:36:48.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也算是男子汉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.75,0:36:49.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是女生
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.39,0:36:52.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过这样也很好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.89,0:36:55.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许就可以解开巨神像的谜团了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.83,0:37:01.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么就继续昨天的行程
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.60,0:37:02.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立刻出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.52,0:37:06.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.46,0:37:07.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发之前
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.10,0:37:11.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先把你身上的道具留下来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.11,0:37:12.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.66,0:37:15.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万一遇到危险的事情那怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.75,0:37:17.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,依赖那些道具也太卑鄙了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.15,0:37:19.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要用双手和勇气
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.62,0:37:21.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,度过难关才行
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.68,0:37:23.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,双手和勇气
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.18,0:37:41.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.77,0:37:43.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扁扁好像想帮我们带路耶
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.48,0:37:46.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的耶 拜托你啰 扁扁
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.48,0:37:50.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,远离人类的文明世界
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.26,0:37:54.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像这样坐在老旧的船上 一路摇晃着
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.76,0:37:58.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让人有种…随时会出事的危机感
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.38,0:38:03.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道该怎么形容这种心情对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.32,0:38:06.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉就像变成李文斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.09,0:38:07.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或史坦利了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.13,0:38:11.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 小夫 换我来驾驶
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.23,0:38:14.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎怎么可能会驾驶这艘船呢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.78,0:38:22.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样啊 我的掌舵技术很不错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.12,0:38:26.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前方发现大岩石 请紧急回避
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.63,0:38:41.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不像话
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.83,0:38:44.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次来到空地 都常看到有人乱丢垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.96,0:38:46.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然连门都丢在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.15,0:38:49.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不顾虑附近居民的观感
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.03,0:38:50.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.40,0:39:00.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 静香
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.10,0:39:02.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看那里
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.92,0:39:05.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是鳄鱼耶
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.02,0:39:07.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把我们团团围住了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.82,0:39:11.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕哦
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.32,0:39:14.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用担心 这艘船很大很安全的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.72,0:39:15.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看好了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.98,0:39:17.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我丢
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.88,0:39:22.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道我的厉害了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.38,0:39:23.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丢得好准哦
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.30,0:39:24.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明星投手
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.08,0:39:27.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎不是在掌舵吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.76,0:39:41.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛哦
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.66,0:39:45.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕 船底破了一个大洞
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.20,0:39:49.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了 船渐渐往下沉了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.06,0:39:53.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法修理
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.40,0:39:55.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.46,0:40:00.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.11,0:40:03.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.98,0:40:04.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.90,0:40:06.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 抓紧哦 - 静香
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.93,0:40:06.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.22,0:40:15.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.72,0:40:17.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.38,0:40:21.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 快跳上来
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.70,0:40:24.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.32,0:40:26.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.30,0:40:30.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不会被你吃掉
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.50,0:40:32.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再这样下去
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.48,0:40:34.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都会被鳄鱼吃掉了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.35,0:40:38.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 快拿桃太郎丸子出来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.06,0:40:39.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我没带过来
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.36,0:40:41.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就拿竹蜻蜓 冲击枪 超人手套
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.78,0:40:42.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或是空气炮
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.72,0:40:44.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才不是全部都留在空地上了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.30,0:40:47.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那用任意门逃走不就好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.02,0:40:48.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对哦…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.50,0:40:51.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我竟然一紧张就忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.52,0:40:53.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任意门
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.56,0:40:55.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.48,0:40:56.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是任意门吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.45,0:40:57.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有门把而已嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.12,0:40:59.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将军吃掉车
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.92,0:41:02.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样啊 小黑
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.50,0:41:03.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无路可退了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.46,0:41:06.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.81,0:41:07.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我哪知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.73,0:41:11.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.58,0:41:15.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扁扁
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.56,0:41:22.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扁扁
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.16,0:41:27.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好可怕 - 快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.72,0:41:27.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.08,0:41:27.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危险
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.30,0:41:37.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.07,0:42:04.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…是鳄鱼…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.26,0:42:05.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.17,0:42:08.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天多亏你们在最危急的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.10,0:42:09.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶来帮助我们
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.42,0:42:10.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且还举办了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.16,0:42:12.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么盛大的派对来欢迎我们
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.41,0:42:14.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太感谢你们几位了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.66,0:42:16.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马鲁卡 巴力雷巴尼
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.75,0:42:18.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塔哥斯达摩鲁卡
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.08,0:42:19.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,章…章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.56,0:42:23.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们到底在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.33,0:42:26.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翻译蒟蒻
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.32,0:42:29.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,库伦巴波雷 欧欧巴坦嘎
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.00,0:42:33.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马鲁卡 巴力雷巴尼塔哥斯达摩鲁卡
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.23,0:42:36.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说今天是神圣的神明祭典
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.36,0:42:38.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位请不用客气多吃一点
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.13,0:42:41.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来不是为我们举行的派对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.63,0:42:47.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾力达巴邬刚…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.58,0:42:49.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴邬刚
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.50,0:42:51.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.02,0:42:54.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卫星照片上的…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.58,0:42:55.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我梦里出现过
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.52,0:42:57.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一模一样耶
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.90,0:42:58.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住在这里的人
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.86,0:43:00.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该看过真正的巴邬刚才对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.00,0:43:03.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想巨神像一定就在这附近喔
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.36,0:43:03.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,索鲁
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.19,0:43:08.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩鲁巴 巴邬刚 谁姆谁姆达利
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.53,0:43:11.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说如果想见到巴邬刚的神明
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.63,0:43:13.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要有三条性命
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.10,0:43:14.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要三条性命
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.30,0:43:16.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在稀树草原
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.53,0:43:18.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会遭遇到七的七倍的牙之王
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.93,0:43:21.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里会失去第一条性命
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.80,0:43:25.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奥多罗多隆山谷
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.61,0:43:28.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一座断崖接连着死灵之国
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.85,0:43:30.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那里又会失去第二条性命
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.35,0:43:33.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再往前走
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.28,0:43:35.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是被永恒迷雾所笼罩的神之国
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.10,0:43:38.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一旦踏入就再也无法活着回来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.06,0:43:41.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以会失去第三条性命
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.86,0:43:43.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是这么可怕的地方啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.26,0:43:45.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.58,0:43:49.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么话 你们太没用了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.56,0:43:51.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不怕这些无聊的迷信呢
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.70,0:43:53.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我们要寻找的大魔境
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.40,0:43:54.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.33,0:43:56.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定要见到巴邬刚的神明
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.25,0:43:57.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且要得到宝藏
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.68,0:43:59.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就这样告诉他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.78,0:44:02.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡比那巴库伦巴 耶母耶母
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.12,0:44:05.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴邬刚 提拉兹巴咚嘎
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.46,0:44:11.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴拉…耶鲁奇雷马 巴拉…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.83,0:44:12.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.88,0:44:14.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在生什么气啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.32,0:44:17.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这些触怒神明的罪人们
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.66,0:44:19.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在给这个村子带来灾祸之前
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.26,0:44:20.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点滚出去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.60,0:44:21.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否则的话就…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.43,0:44:24.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就会变成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.53,0:44:33.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原本还以为得救了说
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.12,0:44:36.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到情况变得更糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.45,0:44:38.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么声音
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.73,0:44:40.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉好阴森哦
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.76,0:44:43.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在夜晚的丛林里走动实在太危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.56,0:44:45.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天就先在这里露营吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.16,0:44:53.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.73,0:44:56.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了防止野兽攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.93,0:44:59.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以入口设置在正上方哦
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.16,0:45:01.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来这个也是秘密道具
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.41,0:45:04.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 真不愧是哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.22,0:45:07.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请问 里面也有附浴室吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.43,0:45:13.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里面有五个小房间
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.16,0:45:16.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个房间都有床铺跟洗手间哦
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.33,0:45:19.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是没有浴室耶
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.20,0:45:20.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肚子好饿
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.78,0:45:22.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来制造一些拉面的果实吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.52,0:45:23.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好主意 - 赞成
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.13,0:45:23.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.13,0:45:25.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不可以到外面去啦
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.85,0:45:27.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家就忍耐到明天早上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.18,0:45:31.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果现在是在家里面的话
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.11,0:45:32.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就有热腾腾的井饭
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.46,0:45:34.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和清凉的冰沙可以吃了说
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.90,0:45:36.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来我们该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.00,0:45:37.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天知道
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.40,0:45:39.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我那些便利好用的道具
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.97,0:45:41.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都没有带过来
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.50,0:45:44.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们为什么要来这么危险的地方旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.43,0:45:47.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的意思是在怪我啰
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.60,0:45:49.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又没有人这样说 你不要误会啦
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.03,0:45:50.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.23,0:45:53.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算没说出口也写在你们的脸上了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.80,0:45:54.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像整件事
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.68,0:45:56.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是我一个人的错一样
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.80,0:45:57.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.56,0:45:59.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,计划这次探险的人就是我
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.50,0:46:01.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不要带道具过来的人也是我
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.40,0:46:03.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,船之所以会沉没
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.86,0:46:06.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有害大家被人从村子里赶出来
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.22,0:46:07.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也全都是我的错不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.28,0:46:10.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正我本来…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.02,0:46:12.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是被大家嫌弃的讨厌鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.88,0:46:16.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.18,0:46:18.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太夸张了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.32,0:46:19.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么态度
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.40,0:46:21.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干嘛一个人乱发脾气
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.66,0:46:23.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别管他 别管他了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.43,0:46:27.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扁扁 跟我一起睡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.08,0:46:31.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它跑到哪里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.58,0:46:49.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扁扁
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.20,0:46:58.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扁扁
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.26,0:47:03.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我到底该怎么办才好
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.83,0:47:16.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从地图来看
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.13,0:47:18.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要穿过这片稀树草原
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.16,0:47:21.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该就可以到达老烟枪丛林才对
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.78,0:47:23.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里好宽敞哦
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.49,0:47:25.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遭遇牙之王会失去一条性命…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.75,0:47:26.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.38,0:47:29.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之先往前进吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.30,0:47:30.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许在巨神像附近
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.53,0:47:31.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会有人居住也说不定
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.32,0:47:34.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们能顺利走到那里就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.00,0:47:44.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了 扁扁
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.12,0:47:44.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看那里
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.16,0:47:49.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好壮观 是一群大象耶
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.90,0:47:50.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.88,0:47:53.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来牙之王所指的就是大象啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.90,0:47:56.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大只哦
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.28,0:47:58.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可爱哦 是象宝宝耶
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.25,0:48:14.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.40,0:48:16.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们是怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.16,0:48:26.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是狮子 快逃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.10,0:48:36.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真正的牙之王是狮子才对啦
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.66,0:48:41.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办啦
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.86,0:48:43.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点往反方向逃跑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.73,0:48:48.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕 被包围了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.40,0:48:50.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.87,0:48:53.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 振作起来
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.20,0:48:54.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能放弃一起战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.92,0:48:57.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,面对这一大群狮子是要怎样战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.33,0:49:02.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扁扁 你要去哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.48,0:49:04.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.20,0:49:05.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.23,0:49:08.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快过来我这里
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.50,0:49:24.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.12,0:49:51.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴邬刚的神像
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.06,0:49:52.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么会在这里出现呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.00,0:49:59.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿过去了…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.93,0:50:13.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.22,0:50:18.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通往王国的道路已经开启了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.32,0:50:22.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点继续前进吧 少年们
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.68,0:50:26.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.88,0:50:33.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扁扁
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.38,0:50:38.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扁扁 你没事真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.06,0:50:42.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.50,0:50:43.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.13,0:50:46.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扁扁的脸看起来好像巨神像哦
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.88,0:50:47.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听你这么说…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.38,0:50:50.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们之间 有什么关连吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.23,0:50:52.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能会有关连呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.18,0:50:54.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重要的是现在该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.10,0:50:56.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在到达王国之前
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.50,0:50:57.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家还必须白白牺牲掉
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.90,0:50:59.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两条性命才行耶
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.10,0:51:01.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还能怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.58,0:51:03.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唯一的办法就是继续前进
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.88,0:51:05.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香 你觉得怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.75,0:51:08.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我最担心的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.76,0:51:10.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那个王国里
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.88,0:51:12.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底有没有浴室可以用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.65,0:51:14.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇哩勒…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.72,0:51:16.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,饶了我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.43,0:51:19.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想要听听看胖虎的意见
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.02,0:51:21.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然你都不说话
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.39,0:51:22.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直闷闷不乐的…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.88,0:51:24.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.10,0:51:30.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎好像变成另外一个人似的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.78,0:51:32.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都不说话感觉怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.90,0:51:34.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.60,0:51:37.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是什么王国都好
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.33,0:51:38.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只希望能快点到就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.15,0:51:45.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,火车游戏绳
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.08,0:51:49.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个道具好逊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.32,0:51:50.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么火车游戏嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.16,0:51:52.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然看起来有点逊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.48,0:51:54.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是速度跟真正的火车一样快哦
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.20,0:51:57.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好陡的悬崖
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.52,0:52:00.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这谷底一定是连接着死灵之国啦
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.70,0:52:07.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我们只能搭这个下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.58,0:52:08.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁要第一个坐
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.97,0:52:11.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最后一个下去就好了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.11,0:52:14.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 你就先当第一个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.32,0:52:16.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用… 大雄不要客气
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.08,0:52:17.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是你先请吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.05,0:52:18.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的不用这么客气啦
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.42,0:52:19.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你才不用礼让我啦 - 让我下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.86,0:52:19.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.60,0:52:22.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.88,0:52:27.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不愧是胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.18,0:52:28.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好勇敢哦
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.73,0:52:35.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.08,0:52:38.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在中途卡住了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.68,0:52:39.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡住了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.85,0:52:43.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点想办法 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.05,0:52:45.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说过了那些方便的道具
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.55,0:52:46.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都没有带来这里嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.06,0:52:48.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.02,0:52:50.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定可以用那个哦
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.00,0:52:52.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重力油漆
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.88,0:52:55.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要涂上油漆就可以马上变成地面
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.03,0:52:56.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大楼墙壁或天花板…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.10,0:52:57.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用再说明了…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.96,0:53:05.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万一踩出油漆的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.59,0:53:07.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就会掉下去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.56,0:53:10.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉比东京铁塔还要高呢
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.72,0:53:21.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚好油漆也用完了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.32,0:53:24.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好阴森的地方哦
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.32,0:53:27.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里真的就是死灵之国啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.20,0:53:30.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们快点爬上对面的悬崖吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.42,0:53:37.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是岩石发出的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.33,0:53:40.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诡异的亮光 诡异的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.33,0:53:42.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里果然有死灵存在
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.98,0:53:46.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朝这边过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.18,0:53:49.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.02,0:53:51.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.20,0:53:55.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.90,0:53:56.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.78,0:53:58.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 可恶… - 好厉害哦
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.28,0:53:58.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.26,0:53:59.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全都被打散了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.76,0:54:03.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然还是我们的胖虎最强了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.90,0:54:04.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好酷哦
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.28,0:54:06.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我抓到它的灵魂了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.79,0:54:11.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个是…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.05,0:54:13.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉像是蚊子之类的小虫
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.00,0:54:15.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身上沾满了发光的菌体
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.98,0:54:16.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.12,0:54:19.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要搞清楚原因就不可怕了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.90,0:54:21.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死灵的声音也是一样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.00,0:54:23.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想一定可以用科学的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.74,0:54:24.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来说明才对
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.06,0:54:28.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好烫…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.33,0:54:29.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事吧 小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.83,0:54:31.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我明白啰
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.02,0:54:34.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这附近是火山地带啦
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.18,0:54:36.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以有的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.26,0:54:38.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会像这样从地底喷出水蒸气
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.85,0:54:41.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,导致这些布满很多孔洞的岩石
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.16,0:54:42.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,产生了共鸣
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.66,0:54:44.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就跟吹笛子的原理是一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.73,0:54:45.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.83,0:54:47.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫果然聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.30,0:54:55.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.52,0:54:57.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不愧是我所选中的勇者们
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.10,0:55:02.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扁扁说话了…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.21,0:55:05.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有要吓你们的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.58,0:55:08.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我应该早点说明
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.45,0:55:10.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托各位帮助我才对
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.62,0:55:11.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站起来了…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.35,0:55:13.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我认为
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.26,0:55:15.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们可能不会相信我说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.66,0:55:17.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才决定让你们来到这个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.96,0:55:19.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲眼确认这些事
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.36,0:55:19.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扁扁…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.62,0:55:22.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底是…什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.36,0:55:23.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.26,0:55:26.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是巴邬刚一百零八世的儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.62,0:55:27.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯达克王子
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.30,0:55:29.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.70,0:55:31.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴邬刚的儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.81,0:55:33.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为某些原因去了一趟日本
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.11,0:55:35.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托各位的福
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.21,0:55:37.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在总算可以回到这里来了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.60,0:55:39.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样…那个巨神像是…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.48,0:55:41.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是创建王国的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.88,0:55:43.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴邬刚一世的石像
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.80,0:55:45.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是用这个宝石 投射出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.88,0:55:55.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然很像立体摄像机
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.72,0:55:56.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过还是有点不同
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.73,0:56:00.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个宝石 是皇家代代相传的宝物
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.20,0:56:03.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面详细记录着巨神像的一举一动
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.37,0:56:05.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害哦
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.66,0:56:08.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个比人类的文明还要先进很多呢
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.91,0:56:09.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.91,0:56:12.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的王国应该很繁荣才对啰
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.76,0:56:13.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很遗憾的…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.13,0:56:15.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并不是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.48,0:56:17.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,详细的情形
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.59,0:56:19.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就边走边说明好了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.90,0:56:21.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之得加紧脚步才行
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.69,0:56:24.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通往王国的道路只有唯一一条
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.13,0:56:26.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这个地下洞窟
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.16,0:56:28.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这条河川的水
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.60,0:56:30.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是从王国里的湖泊流出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.53,0:56:32.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.37,0:56:33.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,属于狗狗的王国
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.03,0:56:35.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是令人难以置信啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.23,0:56:38.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我也跟你们一样
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.67,0:56:40.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我亲眼看见之前
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.41,0:56:41.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也根本不相信
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.78,0:56:43.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界上会有一个属于人类的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.76,0:56:45.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有可能…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.96,0:56:47.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是在好几百万年前
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.62,0:56:49.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生地壳大变动造成的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.62,0:56:52.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陆地的一部分地层下陷
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.03,0:56:53.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使得我们这里
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.06,0:56:55.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与外面的世界完全隔绝
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.26,0:56:58.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外面的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.63,0:57:00.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猴子的祖先经过进化后
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.49,0:57:01.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,演变成了人类
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.10,0:57:04.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而在我们的世界进化的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.23,0:57:05.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,则是狗的祖先
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.87,0:57:09.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经没路了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.47,0:57:11.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来好像是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.93,0:57:14.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 你快点想想办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.76,0:57:17.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,办法也不是说想就想得出来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.58,0:57:19.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 那个也许派得上用场
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.22,0:57:21.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鲤鱼船
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.23,0:57:25.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像鲤鱼游上瀑布一样
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.95,0:57:27.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以逆流而上前进喔
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.99,0:57:29.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个好方便哦
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.82,0:57:31.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扁扁 你很开心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.50,0:57:33.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于可以回到久违的故乡了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.80,0:57:34.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然很开心没错
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.22,0:57:36.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过开心归开心
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.98,0:57:37.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们王国
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.03,0:57:39.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有可怕的敌人正在等着我
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.43,0:57:41.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.83,0:57:44.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前面有光
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.10,0:57:46.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们到达地面了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.90,0:58:11.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就是…狗狗的王国
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.28,0:58:19.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好巨大的水车
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.08,0:58:21.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个水车
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.00,0:58:23.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了能把收获的农作物加工
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.02,0:58:26.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有可以将水输送到王宫的功用
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.86,0:58:28.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮的地方哦
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.03,0:58:34.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快趴下
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.26,0:58:37.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎…怎么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.18,0:58:37.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘘
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.36,0:58:41.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狗狗的军队
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.00,0:58:45.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.20,0:58:48.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好像听到对面传来奇怪的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.48,0:58:50.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是你听错了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.40,0:58:52.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是赶快跟上
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.22,0:58:54.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.12,0:59:00.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.08,0:59:02.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.00,0:59:04.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是夺取我父亲王位的大臣
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.16,0:59:06.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达布兰靼的部下们
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.45,0:59:07.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达布兰靼
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.23,0:59:10.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是拥有邪恶智慧的可怕敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.13,0:59:12.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目前这个国家
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.38,0:59:14.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是在达布兰靼的统治之下
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.00,0:59:16.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我们要去哪里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.00,0:59:18.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去布鲁斯的官邸
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.33,0:59:21.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁斯是我父亲的亲卫队队长
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.00,0:59:23.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是这个国家里
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.43,0:59:24.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最值得我信赖的人
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.36,0:59:28.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又要趴下
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.68,0:59:34.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是…不小心跌倒而已
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.88,0:59:36.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁斯
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.82,0:59:38.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 布鲁斯在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.90,0:59:40.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来好惨哦
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.19,0:59:41.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来好像没有人在
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.36,0:59:44.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想恐怕是被敌人抓走了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.16,0:59:46.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本来以为
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.36,0:59:48.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁斯应该不会有事才对
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.13,0:59:51.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么你还有其他可以信任的人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.27,0:59:53.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果连他也被抓…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.76,0:59:55.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就没有人…站在我这边了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.26,0:59:56.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扁扁…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.32,0:59:59.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事情为什么会变成这样呢
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.91,1:00:02.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在五千年前
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.93,1:00:03.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们王国
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.08,1:00:05.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拥有比现在的王国
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.38,1:00:06.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更先进的高度文明
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.08,1:00:11.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的祖先运用科学的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.69,1:00:12.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发明出喷火车
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.32,1:00:14.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及飞天船等等
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.76,1:00:16.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些非常可怕的武器
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.92,1:00:20.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 贤能的巴邬刚一世发现
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.50,1:00:22.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果无止尽发明新武器
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.48,1:00:24.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将会导致世界迈向毁灭
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.46,1:00:26.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是下令禁止武器研究
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.32,1:00:28.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并且将所有研究纪录封印
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.90,1:00:30.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除此之外
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.05,1:00:32.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还下令建造巨神像
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.00,1:00:34.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用来做为我们王国的守护神
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.63,1:00:37.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,经过了五千年的岁月
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.46,1:00:39.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然我们的科学力量衰退了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.48,1:00:41.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王国却得以保持和平的状态
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.43,1:00:44.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.76,1:00:46.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,篡夺父亲王位的大臣达布兰靼
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.10,1:00:48.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拥有邪恶的野心
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.30,1:00:57.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他企图让古代武器复活
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.38,1:00:59.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,侵略外面的世界强大我们国家
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.63,1:01:01.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这个吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.42,1:01:03.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该不会错
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.18,1:01:17.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太美了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.73,1:01:20.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这正是失落已久的古代武器纪录啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.13,1:01:26.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样世界就是我的囊中之物了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.82,1:01:31.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是在我
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.83,1:01:34.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和丝比雅娜公主结婚典礼的前一天
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.70,1:01:36.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手给我
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.53,1:01:37.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.62,1:01:43.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个国家将由我来负责守护
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.32,1:01:46.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且…我也会守护你
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.98,1:01:52.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望这份和平 能够永远持续下去
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.73,1:01:54.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.76,1:01:56.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.40,1:01:58.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你在这里等我一下
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.60,1:02:07.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下雨了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.02,1:02:10.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯达克王子
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.82,1:02:12.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了吗 雪纳瑞
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.81,1:02:14.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大事不好了 王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.82,1:02:16.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请听我说 国王陛下他…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.33,1:02:22.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父王陛下
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.30,1:02:25.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父王陛下
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.22,1:02:27.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父王陛下
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.22,1:02:29.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父王陛下
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.56,1:02:31.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来可能是这个杯子
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.23,1:02:33.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被暗中涂了毒药呢
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.92,1:02:36.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好像记得这个杯子哦
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.26,1:02:39.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是王子送给国王的礼物吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.46,1:02:47.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你的阴谋吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.10,1:02:48.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阴谋
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.13,1:02:52.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底在胡说些什么
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.82,1:02:54.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与其在这里胡言乱语
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.48,1:02:56.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,倒不如先担心你自己吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.19,1:02:59.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把这个叛徒给我抓起来
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.65,1:03:09.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别跑…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.76,1:03:17.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.00,1:03:19.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那里
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.86,1:03:24.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我等你很久了 肯达克王子
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.42,1:03:46.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.36,1:03:49.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就这样被地下河流冲了出去
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.23,1:03:53.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一次闯入了人类世界
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.58,1:03:54.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知所措的我
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.96,1:03:56.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,躲进了停在港口的一艘船里
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.12,1:03:58.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是一艘
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.16,1:04:01.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往来于非洲和日本之间的载货船
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.66,1:04:04.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直很想找机会回国
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.66,1:04:05.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在我无助的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.50,1:04:08.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄正好救了虚弱的我
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.04,1:04:11.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不打倒达布兰靼的话
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.99,1:04:13.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的王国就没有未来了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.53,1:04:15.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.58,1:04:17.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道这很强人所难
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.50,1:04:18.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.23,1:04:19.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请各位助我一臂之力好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.72,1:04:21.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.06,1:04:22.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扁扁
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.30,1:04:25.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…你别开玩笑啦
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.00,1:04:27.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们明明是来找寻宝藏的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.00,1:04:29.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在为什么非得被卷入
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.26,1:04:30.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种麻烦事不可
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.91,1:04:32.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算要我用走的也没关系
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.71,1:04:33.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们快回日本啦
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.31,1:04:36.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们怎么可以这样一走了之
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.62,1:04:37.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是说啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.48,1:04:38.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可以见死不救
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.60,1:04:39.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丢下扁扁不管呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.16,1:04:42.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是你说我们又能帮上什么忙
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.66,1:04:44.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一起来想办法嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.49,1:04:45.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有用啦
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.29,1:04:46.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会没用
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.10,1:04:52.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要跑
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.46,1:04:53.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,臭小鬼头
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.43,1:04:58.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 抓到你了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.38,1:05:00.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是个调皮捣蛋的狡猾小鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.73,1:05:03.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个对付一个太卑鄙了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.68,1:05:05.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有本事就单挑啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.22,1:05:08.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伯纳 他说我们两个是卑鄙小人
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.58,1:05:11.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我才不是卑鄙小人呢
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.68,1:05:14.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.38,1:05:18.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你竟敢咬我的鼻子
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.48,1:05:20.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会再手下留情了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.76,1:05:21.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.00,1:05:26.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是什么人
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.12,1:05:28.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟敢对小孩使用暴力
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.70,1:05:29.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我饶不了你们
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.22,1:05:31.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶的小子
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.21,1:05:35.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.16,1:05:37.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要跑
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.20,1:05:43.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.28,1:05:50.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我认输
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.00,1:05:56.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说你 该不会是…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.54,1:05:58.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看…看到鬼了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.00,1:05:58.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.23,1:06:00.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到鬼了…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.56,1:06:03.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扁扁 你很厉害嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.88,1:06:05.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 看来他们应该察觉到 - 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.42,1:06:05.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.38,1:06:06.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的身份了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.55,1:06:09.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的名字叫做奇波
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.70,1:06:10.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我承认
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.31,1:06:12.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然偷他们的便当是我的不对
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.05,1:06:15.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是因为我实在快饿死了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.48,1:06:17.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你的爸爸妈妈呢
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.63,1:06:19.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都被他们抓走了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.39,1:06:21.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有村子里的人也是
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.32,1:06:22.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被他们抓走了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.82,1:06:25.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,军队突然跑到我们村子里抓人
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.36,1:06:33.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.40,1:06:35.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个可以给小普和小乌吃吗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.68,1:06:37.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚刚不是才喂过它们吗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.46,1:06:38.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们说还想再吃嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.98,1:06:39.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇波
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.10,1:06:41.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就随他去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.70,1:06:44.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.63,1:06:47.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.26,1:06:49.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你们马上说清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.93,1:06:51.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达布兰靼大人下达命令
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.38,1:06:53.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从今天开始
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.62,1:06:55.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任命你们为武器制造人员
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.56,1:06:57.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直岂有此理
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.20,1:06:59.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们离开了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.36,1:07:01.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说田地跟家畜谁来照顾呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.38,1:07:03.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 把他们带走 - 乖乖跟我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.70,1:07:03.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.76,1:07:04.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.40,1:07:05.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.16,1:07:05.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要反抗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.53,1:07:09.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手 不准你们欺负我爸爸妈妈啦
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.12,1:07:10.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚一边去
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.13,1:07:11.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.92,1:07:14.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇波…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.26,1:07:20.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我一定要把爸爸妈妈救出来才行
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.38,1:07:23.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看 我连剑都做好了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.22,1:07:25.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇波…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.56,1:07:29.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,借我看看好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.20,1:07:34.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是把好剑
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.66,1:07:35.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.92,1:07:37.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扁扁
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.43,1:07:40.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请让我们也来帮忙好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.00,1:07:42.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.70,1:07:44.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然啰
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.73,1:07:46.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有我们也一样哦
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.37,1:07:47.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信只要大家同心协力
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.11,1:07:49.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定可以克服难关的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.46,1:07:54.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.72,1:07:56.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也会帮忙可以了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.96,1:08:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太感谢了…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.40,1:08:01.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你们大家…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.02,1:08:02.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然决定了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.99,1:08:04.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就来研究作战计划吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.58,1:08:26.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.92,1:08:32.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做得真是好极了 可斯博士
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.82,1:08:34.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大人 您过奖了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.38,1:08:37.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管外面的世界有什么样的敌人
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.16,1:08:38.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在都不用害怕了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.62,1:08:43.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您说得一点也没错
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.28,1:08:44.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了要制造出几千
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.60,1:08:46.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至几万台这种武器
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.60,1:08:48.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在正从全国各地召集人手
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.63,1:08:49.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加紧赶工
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.27,1:08:53.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达布兰靼大人成为世界之王的日子
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.13,1:08:54.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也已经距离不远了哦
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.50,1:08:58.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达布兰靼大人
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.07,1:08:59.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有重大的事向您禀报
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.71,1:09:01.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 你说王子
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.43,1:09:03.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.55,1:09:04.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子不是早就已经
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.72,1:09:06.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沉到湖底见阎王去了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.82,1:09:09.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我亲眼看到 是他没错啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.62,1:09:10.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.26,1:09:12.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的身边还带着五只奇怪的生物
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.26,1:09:15.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像是穿着衣服的猴子一样…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.46,1:09:17.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有一只狸猫混在里面
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.83,1:09:18.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道是…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.97,1:09:21.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴邬刚一世的预言…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.40,1:09:23.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是人数并不符合
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.46,1:09:25.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管他们是谁都无所谓
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.70,1:09:27.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要是可疑人物全部抓起来
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.40,1:09:29.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达布兰靼大人
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.30,1:09:32.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是真正的王子的话
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.22,1:09:34.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可是个剑术高手啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.61,1:09:35.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这件事
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.58,1:09:37.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是交给萨贝鲁队长去处理吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.89,1:09:40.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚开…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.08,1:09:53.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别挡路 还不快点让开
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.03,1:09:55.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.46,1:09:59.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下来
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.32,1:10:02.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小弟弟 马车上装的是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.28,1:10:03.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.50,1:10:07.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是准备要拿去市场卖的蔬菜
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.20,1:10:10.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么让我们检查也没关系吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.36,1:10:12.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.03,1:10:31.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨贝鲁队长
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.73,1:10:34.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并没有发现任何可疑的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.15,1:10:36.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,车上只找到这个而已
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.88,1:10:40.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小弟弟 真是不好意思
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.92,1:10:42.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我闻到了奇怪的味道
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.18,1:10:43.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.16,1:10:51.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子 现在已经没事了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.86,1:11:00.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才好惊险
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.18,1:11:02.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们果然已经派人来追杀我了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.70,1:11:05.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过变身饮料也已经全部喝完了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.12,1:11:19.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不愧是肯达克王子
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.69,1:11:21.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事情变得越来越有趣了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.40,1:11:36.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立刻动员所有的士兵
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.37,1:11:37.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彻底进行全面搜索
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.22,1:11:40.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,务必要将王子跟他的同党
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.29,1:11:41.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通通给我抓起来
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.68,1:11:44.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来传闻是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.76,1:11:45.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.73,1:11:48.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁斯就被关在这座城堡的地底下
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.70,1:11:52.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家熟悉的法宝穿透环
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.90,1:11:54.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请小心一点哦
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.80,1:11:55.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.82,1:11:58.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的有好多不可思议的道具哦
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.54,1:12:00.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没时间赞叹了 快走快走啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.80,1:12:13.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么是我们负责留守的工作
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.86,1:12:16.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这边
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.20,1:12:18.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉真糟糕耶
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.38,1:12:20.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该不会有感觉很好的牢房吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.08,1:12:26.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁斯
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.43,1:12:28.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁斯
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.08,1:12:30.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我啦 布鲁斯
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.63,1:12:32.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个声音 这个味道
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.93,1:12:34.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.30,1:12:36.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在不是在作梦吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.22,1:12:37.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘘
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.12,1:12:43.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有事等一下再说 快点离开这里
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.30,1:12:47.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要边走边打瞌睡
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.62,1:12:48.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁斯
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.06,1:12:51.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事情不好了…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.26,1:12:59.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘘
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.73,1:13:02.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,犯人逃走了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.78,1:13:03.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让他跑了…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.68,1:13:04.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被发现了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.20,1:13:05.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动作快
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.86,1:13:07.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下糟了啦
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.86,1:13:08.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.02,1:13:09.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.13,1:13:11.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都没事
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.10,1:13:12.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁斯也找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.70,1:13:16.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 快点
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.33,1:13:29.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贤能的巴邬刚一世大人
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.00,1:13:31.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请您一定要聆听我的祈祷
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.90,1:13:33.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的王国
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.68,1:13:35.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在被邪恶的人们所控制
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.09,1:13:38.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国民都深陷黑暗之中彷徨无助
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.33,1:13:41.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求求您 给予这个国家
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.50,1:13:43.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,指引的光芒吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.52,1:13:56.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.38,1:13:58.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公主殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.48,1:14:00.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我应该先敲门
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.13,1:14:02.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系啦 多鲁
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.88,1:14:04.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大事不好了 公主殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.82,1:14:05.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.88,1:14:07.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说王子殿下已经回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.42,1:14:09.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子他…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.98,1:14:11.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是真的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.42,1:14:13.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子他果然还平安活着
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.66,1:14:15.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当初听说了王子去世的消息
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.98,1:14:17.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎样我都没办法相信
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.06,1:14:20.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.33,1:14:23.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可千万不要受骗上当哦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.60,1:14:25.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丝比雅娜公主
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.33,1:14:27.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个冒牌王子跟他的同党
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.42,1:14:29.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快就会被我们抓到了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.66,1:14:30.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.33,1:14:32.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通通都会被判处死刑哦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.30,1:14:35.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你还是早日忘了王子
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.90,1:14:37.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成为我的王妃
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.13,1:14:38.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对你比较好哦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.92,1:14:39.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太失礼了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.30,1:14:42.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下才不会这么轻易
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.16,1:14:43.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就被你们抓住
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.63,1:14:45.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一定会跟我们的国民们
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.19,1:14:47.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同心协力 拯救这个国家
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.62,1:14:49.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是伤脑筋
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.18,1:14:50.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然如此
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.17,1:14:51.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只好让你亲眼确认
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.62,1:14:53.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才会彻底死心吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.03,1:14:55.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在明天早上之前
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.60,1:14:56.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子的首级
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.22,1:14:58.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定会送来给你
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.20,1:15:05.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公主殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.75,1:15:08.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子…你一定要平安无事
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.48,1:15:15.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要是行踪可疑的都别放过
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.90,1:15:17.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算要把树根都挖出来
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.69,1:15:18.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也要把人给我找到
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.48,1:15:20.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家给我听好了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.26,1:15:22.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冒牌王子跟他的同党
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.98,1:15:24.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就躲在这座城里的某个角落
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.38,1:15:25.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看好
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.16,1:15:28.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这四只猴子跟一只狸猫
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.80,1:15:31.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁敢藏匿他们都会判处死刑哦
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.82,1:15:33.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通报他们藏身处的人
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.52,1:15:35.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以获得一年份的骨头呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.98,1:15:37.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一…一年份的骨头
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.76,1:15:39.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离我远一点
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.82,1:15:42.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪 大家都跑光了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.86,1:15:46.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达布兰靼大人太不得人心了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.86,1:15:50.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪 不用看守这里没关系吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.50,1:15:51.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.62,1:15:53.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要去抓住他们才能领赏不是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.06,1:15:55.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不愧是布爹利
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.42,1:15:57.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这辈子跟定你了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.83,1:16:02.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不是狸猫 不是狸猫啦
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.20,1:16:04.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘘 会被发现啦 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.70,1:16:06.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是因为他们没有看过猫咪啦
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.36,1:16:09.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算这样也不能说我是狸猫啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.61,1:16:12.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 他们到底是什么人啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.76,1:16:15.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们几位是来自外面世界的勇者们
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.62,1:16:18.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 来自外面世界的勇者
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.45,1:16:19.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.88,1:16:21.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴邬刚一世陛下的预言
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.82,1:16:22.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.26,1:16:24.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么预言啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.56,1:16:27.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是皇家流传下来的一个古老传说
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.40,1:16:30.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在国家纷乱的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.28,1:16:32.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会有十位外国人来到这里
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.40,1:16:34.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并且启动巨神的心
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.52,1:16:37.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的十位外国人
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.52,1:16:39.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是指我们几个吗
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.52,1:16:41.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我们只有五个人耶
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.73,1:16:42.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另外的五个人
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.88,1:16:44.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底会从哪里来呢
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.73,1:16:46.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能还会有别人来这里
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.36,1:16:48.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所谓启动巨神的心
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.10,1:16:50.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是什么意思呢
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.98,1:16:51.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.40,1:16:53.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.22,1:16:55.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我曾经听说巨神像的内部是空的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.92,1:16:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许进去里面
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.22,1:16:58.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能知道什么也说不定
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.46,1:17:00.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么要赌赌看吗
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.32,1:17:08.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人家肚子饿得快死掉了啦
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.94,1:17:09.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说得也是
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.12,1:17:12.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经很久没有吃东西了耶
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.22,1:17:15.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得想想办法才行
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.36,1:17:19.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,预约对讲机
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.80,1:17:21.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要跟这个对讲机预先约定好
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.95,1:17:23.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就可以事先得到你想要的结果哦
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.53,1:17:27.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之 先试试看再说
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.52,1:17:28.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟你约定好
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.03,1:17:31.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明天无论如何都会去吃饭哦
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.23,1:17:33.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以现在先让我填饱肚子吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.40,1:17:40.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我闻到一股好香的味道哦
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.23,1:17:44.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,食物的好滋味在嘴巴里散发开来了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.10,1:17:46.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.38,1:17:49.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的肚子已经饱到吃不下了啦
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.68,1:17:51.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太惊人了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.38,1:17:52.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天吃饭的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.90,1:17:55.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要连今天的份也一起吃完哦
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.06,1:17:56.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.82,1:17:58.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个道具可以借我一下吗
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.85,1:18:00.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还没吃饱吗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.86,1:18:01.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是呢
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.36,1:18:03.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟你约定好
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.68,1:18:05.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说什么都一定会尽快去洗澡的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.28,1:18:08.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以现在先让我把身体洗干净吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.43,1:18:13.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉清爽多了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.30,1:18:16.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家晚安啰
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.58,1:18:27.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要尿尿
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.43,1:18:41.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁斯
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.68,1:18:42.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公主她…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.83,1:18:44.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丝比雅娜公主…她平安吗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.76,1:18:46.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公主目前被软禁在皇宫里
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.93,1:18:47.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过没事
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.56,1:18:51.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说公主她 为了我们王国
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.60,1:18:53.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日夜不停地向上天祈祷呢
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.86,1:19:00.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扁扁
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.35,1:19:02.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这样不行啦
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.68,1:19:04.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万一被人发现怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.16,1:19:06.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.40,1:19:09.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.92,1:19:11.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我实在睡不着
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.96,1:19:13.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是哦
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.08,1:19:15.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只要三秒钟
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.26,1:19:17.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就可以睡得不醒人事了说
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.46,1:19:21.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的…有这个资格
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.03,1:19:24.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以成为这个国家的…国王吗
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.23,1:19:28.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有办法守护任何东西
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.57,1:19:29.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是父王
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.72,1:19:31.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是丝比雅娜公主
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.43,1:19:33.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至奇波的父母亲
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.61,1:19:35.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明知道国民正陷入痛苦之中
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.08,1:19:37.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我却只能傻傻的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.12,1:19:38.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,依靠古老的预言来行动
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.53,1:19:42.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得…自己真的很没用
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.23,1:19:48.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很了不起喔 扁扁
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.73,1:19:51.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不像我
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.68,1:19:53.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光是顾自己就忙不过来了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.00,1:19:55.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,考试总是考零分
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.70,1:19:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连棒球也打不好
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.37,1:19:59.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且总是闯祸惹大家不开心
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.53,1:20:03.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.82,1:20:05.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有唯一一次
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.78,1:20:07.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,考试考一百分的经验哦
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.53,1:20:10.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那时候真的好开心哦
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.56,1:20:13.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然都没有人愿意相信我就是了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.60,1:20:15.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有哦
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.70,1:20:17.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也曾经打过全垒打哦
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.23,1:20:19.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个时候的我
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.33,1:20:20.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭上眼睛全力挥棒
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.76,1:20:22.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果竟然打中了耶
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.23,1:20:23.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连我自己都吓了一大跳
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.02,1:20:25.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果忘记跑垒了啦
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.92,1:20:29.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.08,1:20:31.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到你说得那么陶醉
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.65,1:20:32.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很有趣
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.70,1:20:37.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪 我刚刚说了什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.23,1:20:39.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总而言之
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.20,1:20:41.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想跟你说的其实是…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.36,1:20:43.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扁扁
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.36,1:20:45.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接好哦
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.50,1:20:53.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我想说的就是…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.59,1:20:54.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定可以成为一位
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.96,1:20:56.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常好的国王啦
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.58,1:21:16.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.53,1:21:19.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都已经动员了那么多士兵
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.62,1:21:21.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么还找不到任何线索
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.85,1:21:24.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道是飞上天还是潜到了地底
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.90,1:21:26.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次的敌人还真有一套
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.28,1:21:28.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.38,1:21:29.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们又不是妖魔鬼怪
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.62,1:21:32.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请您先冷静一点
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.53,1:21:35.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,依我看他们八成是
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.23,1:21:37.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打算趁夜深人静的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.27,1:21:39.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偷偷跑去巨神像那边吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.67,1:21:41.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道他们要去那里
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.50,1:21:45.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据皇家流传的那个古老预言
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.96,1:21:48.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在国家纷乱的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.82,1:21:50.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会有十位外国人来到这里
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.50,1:21:54.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并且启动巨神的心
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.06,1:22:03.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位就快到达巨神像的神殿了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.92,1:22:06.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到可以这么顺利耶
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.73,1:22:08.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是已经放弃找我们了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.60,1:22:11.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太过安静了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.06,1:22:14.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些士兵都跑到哪里去了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.93,1:22:16.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个…该不会是…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.72,1:22:30.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕 这果然是陷阱
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.98,1:22:33.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差一点就要抵达巨神像了说
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.58,1:22:43.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就交给我来应付
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.53,1:22:45.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请王子殿下去找巨神像吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.18,1:22:47.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇波
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.96,1:22:48.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.93,1:22:50.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你了 布鲁斯
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.53,1:22:54.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这些人
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.46,1:22:55.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样还敢说自己是
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.68,1:22:57.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴邬刚王国的荣耀士兵吗
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.48,1:23:18.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我们能到达巨神像
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.23,1:23:19.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能得到一线生机了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.13,1:23:21.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你一定要撑到那个时候
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.90,1:23:22.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁斯
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.76,1:23:26.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看 巨神像就在前面了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.42,1:23:39.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.93,1:23:41.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个是喷火车
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.50,1:23:42.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶的达布兰靼
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.83,1:23:44.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的把古代武器重新制造了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.53,1:23:47.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 快点躲到森林
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.40,1:23:52.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警告冒牌王子跟他的同党们
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.72,1:23:56.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这座森林已经完全被我们包围了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.90,1:23:58.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是快点放弃出来投降吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.76,1:24:02.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重复一次
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.10,1:24:04.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点出来投降
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.90,1:24:06.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样还可以饶你们一命
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.42,1:24:08.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是谎言
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.38,1:24:09.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只要一出去
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.48,1:24:10.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定马上就会被杀死
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.56,1:24:13.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,躲起来也是没用的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.40,1:24:14.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动手
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.97,1:24:15.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.62,1:24:26.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把整座森林通通烧掉
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.68,1:24:28.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要把他们逼出来才行
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.22,1:24:31.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看样子…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.60,1:24:34.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁胜谁负已经很清楚了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.56,1:24:36.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家为了我…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.05,1:24:38.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全被逼到走投无路
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.86,1:24:40.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再怎么道歉也没有办法弥补
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.00,1:24:43.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从这座森林往南走
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.52,1:24:44.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就可以看到一个湖泊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.16,1:24:46.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你们从那里逃走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.13,1:24:49.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这段时间 我会留在这里阻挡敌人
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.20,1:24:51.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以啦 这样怎么行
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.62,1:24:53.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你马上就会被抓起来的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.78,1:24:54.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.83,1:24:56.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实在不能继续连累
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.32,1:24:57.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身为外国人的你们了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.58,1:24:59.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇波
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.40,1:25:00.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.22,1:25:03.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定要带他们平安离开这里
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.52,1:25:05.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.01,1:25:06.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然这样
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.85,1:25:08.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扁扁 你也一起走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.56,1:25:11.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在人类世界一起生活不就好了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.52,1:25:14.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果真的能这样的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.59,1:25:15.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那会有多么快乐呢
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.78,1:25:17.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.43,1:25:19.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我身为王子
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.73,1:25:21.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能丢下我的国民不管
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.43,1:25:24.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.70,1:25:26.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你们平安无事
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.10,1:25:27.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扁扁
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.56,1:25:39.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扁扁一个人留下来太危险了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.16,1:25:41.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要跟你去
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.68,1:25:45.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在说什么啦 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.38,1:25:46.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样去跟送死没两样啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.02,1:25:47.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少啰嗦
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.62,1:25:49.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再不快点逃走的话
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.03,1:25:51.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就会被火势包围了哦
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.86,1:25:54.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便你了啦
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.93,1:25:55.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.72,1:25:57.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快点回来
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.33,1:26:02.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎心里一定是觉得
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.00,1:26:05.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会变成这样都是自己的责任吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.76,1:26:08.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以他现在
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.97,1:26:11.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才想用这种方式 为自己闯下的祸负责
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.99,1:26:29.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.48,1:26:30.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.68,1:26:32.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.68,1:26:33.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.80,1:26:35.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.83,1:26:37.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.56,1:26:40.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.26,1:26:44.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.61,1:26:46.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.52,1:26:48.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.58,1:27:07.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.18,1:27:08.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.70,1:27:09.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.96,1:27:11.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.87,1:27:13.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.62,1:27:13.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.26,1:27:20.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.52,1:27:20.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.16,1:27:23.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.12,1:27:25.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果大家都在这里嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.96,1:27:28.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊 大家都要在一起哦
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.93,1:27:30.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从今以后不管发生任何事
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.92,1:27:32.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都要永远永远在一起哦
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.59,1:27:36.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 那就走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.96,1:27:39.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,探险队 出发啰
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.83,1:27:44.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.02,1:28:03.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们过来了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.42,1:28:08.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是王子
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.02,1:28:10.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还真是勇气可嘉
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.22,1:28:13.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要抓起来吗
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.82,1:28:14.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.13,1:28:16.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直接在这里处理掉
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.87,1:28:19.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下一靠近巨神像
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.63,1:28:21.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家就尽全力往前冲
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.67,1:28:24.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我们其中有一个人冲进去就行了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.83,1:28:26.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,预言里所说的外国人
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.45,1:28:28.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另外还有五个一直都还没出现耶
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.98,1:28:31.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么预言 根本就不准啦
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.52,1:28:33.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想到了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.42,1:28:36.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要跟你约定
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.33,1:28:39.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全体士兵 预备
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.70,1:28:41.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定会…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.60,1:28:45.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.66,1:28:50.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进攻
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.86,1:28:53.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是现在 全力往前冲
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.72,1:28:58.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管三七二十一冲向终点就对了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.52,1:29:03.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.86,1:29:05.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.82,1:29:12.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那该不会是…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.32,1:29:14.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些是…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.52,1:29:16.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们是十位外国人
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.23,1:29:24.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让各位久等了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.83,1:29:26.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然还会有另外一组的我们
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.26,1:29:28.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在吃惊还太早哦
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.72,1:29:30.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点进去巨神像里面吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.66,1:29:33.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,士兵们就交给我们来对付吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.36,1:30:05.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从脚下面可以进去里面啦
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.63,1:30:07.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道这种事情呢
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.02,1:30:11.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快把项链的光线对准这里
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.42,1:30:11.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.60,1:30:21.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出现入口了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.88,1:30:22.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 快点进去
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.30,1:30:29.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨贝鲁 快点去追他们
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.40,1:30:31.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看招
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.86,1:30:33.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶啊
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.96,1:30:35.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一小队跟我来
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.36,1:30:37.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对不能让他们接近巨神的心
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.60,1:30:43.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在唯一的目标就是巨神像的心
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.80,1:30:48.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这里吗
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.30,1:30:52.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好酷哦
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.56,1:30:55.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对不对啦 这里是藏宝藏的房间
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.52,1:30:56.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.20,1:30:56.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不好玩
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.52,1:30:58.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是宝藏耶
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.42,1:30:59.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走啦
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.02,1:31:02.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家等等我啦
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.82,1:31:04.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.70,1:31:05.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.62,1:31:07.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要跑
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.60,1:31:14.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这什么地方
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.08,1:31:17.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从那个阶梯上去
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.42,1:31:19.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就可以找到巨神的心了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.28,1:31:20.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我们快点走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.16,1:31:25.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.12,1:31:29.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次都在这种紧要关头
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.36,1:31:31.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,名刀电光丸
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.98,1:31:33.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛好痛哦
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.60,1:31:36.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用那个挡一下敌人吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.13,1:31:42.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然能挡住我的剑
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.12,1:31:44.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来你也是位剑术高手
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.46,1:31:46.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来一决胜负吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.86,1:31:48.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看招
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.92,1:31:53.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这个房间
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.52,1:32:09.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个心型的雕刻
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.93,1:32:11.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是象征着巨神的心啦
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.48,1:32:15.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要启动这个就可以了对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.38,1:32:17.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.56,1:32:22.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要像上发条一样转动它
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.62,1:32:24.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的知道很多我不知道的事耶
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.66,1:32:28.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.73,1:32:37.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看招
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.53,1:32:43.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只不过是五个小孩还是十个小孩
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.20,1:32:44.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点把他们处理掉
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.76,1:32:50.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个是…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.83,1:32:51.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是喷火车
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.06,1:32:56.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.02,1:33:05.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全体舰队
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.46,1:33:07.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备发动火焰攻击
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.90,1:33:08.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发射
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.92,1:33:14.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家快躲到巨神像的后面
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.22,1:33:36.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电量已耗尽
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.00,1:33:38.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.53,1:33:39.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不反击了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.28,1:33:42.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就由我攻过去啰
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.06,1:33:44.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行啦
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.02,1:33:46.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本就转不动嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.50,1:33:47.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五千年没有用过
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.76,1:33:48.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以都生锈了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.63,1:33:52.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来分散力量是不行的
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.78,1:33:54.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家要同心协力才转得动啊
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.86,1:33:55.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.90,1:33:57.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,配合我的声音来用力哦
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.96,1:33:59.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,预…备
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.62,1:34:16.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我手臂已经没力了啦
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.70,1:34:19.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对不能放弃 要相信自己的同伴
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.00,1:34:22.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对不能放弃
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.30,1:34:23.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要战斗到最后一刻啊
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.73,1:34:34.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是胖虎大人啊
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.82,1:34:39.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿命来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.36,1:34:44.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不准小看我
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.10,1:34:50.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.38,1:35:00.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,漂亮的一击
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.15,1:35:10.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨贝鲁队长被打倒了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.18,1:35:13.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃啊
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.89,1:35:17.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.13,1:35:19.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巨神像的心开始启动了耶
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.23,1:35:24.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乌云…聚集过来了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.73,1:35:30.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.13,1:35:33.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫非…那是巨神的心吗
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.36,1:35:56.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.95,1:35:57.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.82,1:35:58.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.30,1:36:19.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 快点看这里
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.73,1:36:33.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎…怎么可能…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.96,1:36:38.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巨…巨神像竟然动起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.78,1:36:52.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 太棒了… - 成功了耶…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.08,1:36:52.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.18,1:36:54.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶的妖怪 吃我这一击吧
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.08,1:37:01.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,击中了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.12,1:37:02.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道厉害了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.88,1:37:05.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.42,1:37:10.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.06,1:37:42.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,石像竟然能像机器人一样动起来
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.50,1:37:44.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是什么原理呢
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.13,1:37:46.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,管它那么多 打垮就对了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.61,1:37:54.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过是个大石块而已
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.11,1:37:55.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么好怕的
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.18,1:37:58.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点准备用远吠炮攻击
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.40,1:37:58.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遵命…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.69,1:38:07.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经准备好了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.92,1:38:08.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.18,1:38:12.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,远吠炮 发射
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.78,1:38:31.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,远吠炮连整座山都能打碎
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.12,1:38:33.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道它的威力了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.85,1:38:35.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把所有的炸弹一起投下去
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.18,1:38:38.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁现在给他致命的一击
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.92,1:38:41.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 加油啊… - 站起来 不能输
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.23,1:38:41.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.23,1:38:43.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 巨神像 绝对不能输 - 加油啊
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.62,1:38:43.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.90,1:38:45.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巨神像 求求你
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.52,1:38:46.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 拯救这个国家吧 - 加油
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.52,1:38:46.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.92,1:38:58.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 被打成这样竟然还能动
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.28,1:39:02.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕了 快点把船调头回去啊
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.06,1:39:03.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好耶…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.16,1:39:04.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.16,1:39:11.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.72,1:39:14.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下糟了 来不及了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.33,1:39:29.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.60,1:39:30.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.08,1:39:33.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可斯博士
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.31,1:39:35.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达布兰靼在什么地方
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.62,1:39:40.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他现在早就已经逃回皇宫去了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.03,1:39:41.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皇宫
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.60,1:39:45.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丝比雅娜公主有危险了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.93,1:39:51.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丝比雅娜公主 请跟我一起逃吧
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.83,1:39:56.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你再靠过来 我就跳下去
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.36,1:39:59.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶 竟敢不听我的话
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.78,1:40:01.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚出来 达布兰靼
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.33,1:40:07.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这…这是怎么一回事
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.28,1:40:09.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我告诉大家实情的
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.66,1:40:12.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子不惜牺牲生命为我们而战
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.56,1:40:21.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然如此
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.93,1:40:23.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就跟我一起死吧
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.00,1:40:26.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,认命吧
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.23,1:40:32.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.53,1:40:37.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巨神像
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.78,1:40:40.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丝比雅娜公主
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.30,1:40:42.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.62,1:40:51.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明发誓说要好好守护你的
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.93,1:40:52.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.23,1:40:53.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.13,1:40:56.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经实现要守护我的誓言了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.10,1:40:58.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看我现在…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.62,1:41:00.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不就被你双手抱着吗
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.28,1:41:02.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丝比雅娜公主
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.46,1:41:05.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的好浪漫哦
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.43,1:41:12.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是巨神像
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.40,1:41:17.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新国王万岁… 新皇后万岁…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.40,1:41:21.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新国王万岁… 新皇后万岁…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.78,1:41:25.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万岁…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.28,1:41:28.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴邬刚国王 万岁…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.63,1:41:32.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.30,1:41:34.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前来拯救我们的你们到底是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.22,1:41:36.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是乘坐时光机
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.63,1:41:37.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从未来过来的你们啊
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.22,1:41:40.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样听得懂吗
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.78,1:41:41.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个时候
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.93,1:41:44.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就和预约对讲机先约定好了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.76,1:41:46.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果能平安无事回家
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.58,1:41:48.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到时候一定会回到过去
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.58,1:41:51.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拯救我们自己现在所遇到的危机啊
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.52,1:41:52.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此啊
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.90,1:41:54.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.38,1:41:57.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 你们也要遵守约定哦
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.40,1:41:59.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定会的
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.98,1:42:01.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个是新的任意门
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.88,1:42:03.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.50,1:42:06.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见啰 要加油哦 我们自己
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.13,1:42:06.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜拜
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.46,1:42:08.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢帮忙哦 我们自己
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.56,1:42:09.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 再见啰 - 拜拜…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.12,1:42:09.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.53,1:42:12.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然已经解开了十位外国人的谜团
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.83,1:42:14.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过还真是个复杂的故事
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.10,1:42:20.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道合不合你们的胃口
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.02,1:42:22.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请尽情享用 多吃一点吧
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.10,1:42:24.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要开动啰…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.08,1:42:25.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.78,1:42:28.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要一次吃完两天的份量也很辛苦呢
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.70,1:42:29.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就给我吃
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.80,1:42:31.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 不可以啦
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.56,1:42:33.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要加油多吃一点哦
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.52,1:42:35.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为已经约定好了嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.63,1:42:36.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个拿去洗
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.80,1:42:37.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个也是
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.53,1:42:41.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么我们非得要来洗碗不可呢
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.02,1:42:44.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布爹利 我不想再跟随你了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.53,1:42:45.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.68,1:42:47.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我还有个私人的请求…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.13,1:42:49.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说浴室吗
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.62,1:42:51.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经替你准备好了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.46,1:42:54.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大的浴室哦
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.13,1:42:56.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干脆来游泳吧
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.32,1:43:01.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来帮您抹肥皂
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.83,1:43:02.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我负责洗头发
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.12,1:43:04.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我负责冲水
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.29,1:43:05.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我负责按摩
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.22,1:43:06.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我负责精油
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.23,1:43:07.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来负责爽身粉
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.72,1:43:10.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洗澡我自己来就行了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.10,1:43:13.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.50,1:43:16.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的非常感谢你们大家的帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.13,1:43:18.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们几位的英勇表现
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.00,1:43:21.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将会永远留存在我们王国的历史里
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.80,1:43:23.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这代表我的心意
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.63,1:43:26.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请收下这份巴邬刚的财宝吧
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.12,1:43:29.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们几个可不是为了那种东西
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.90,1:43:31.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才挺身而战的哦
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.26,1:43:34.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些财宝就当做是你们
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.86,1:43:36.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重建王国的资金吧
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.62,1:43:39.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扁扁
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.46,1:43:41.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定要成为一位好国王哦
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.76,1:43:42.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.80,1:43:45.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你自己也要多多保重哦
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.02,1:43:57.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以这样
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.03,1:43:58.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有关系啦
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.90,1:44:01.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你肚子饿了欢迎你来找我
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.12,1:44:05.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会准备很多很多热狗给你吃哦
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.73,1:44:06.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.62,1:44:08.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定会去找你的
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.62,1:44:09.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定会…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.98,1:44:10.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定会
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.38,1:44:22.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 大家 拜拜啰 - 再见…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.38,1:44:22.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.00,1:44:26.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了 谢谢你们 再见
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.10,1:44:27.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次再见了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.33,1:44:38.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.12,1:44:50.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.98,1:44:53.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一起同心协力重建王国
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.78,1:45:06.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是一场大冒险呢
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.08,1:45:09.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是一个最棒的暑假哦
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.36,1:45:12.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以后我们…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.73,1:45:13.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我们几个长大
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.12,1:45:15.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还能像这样冒险吗
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.96,1:45:29.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我们这样还不算是结束哦
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.92,1:45:30.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.74,1:45:33.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们大家还有一个约定还没完成呢
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.26,1:45:35.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没结束吗
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.43,1:45:36.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打起精神来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.02,1:45:39.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己当然要靠自己去救啊
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.43,1:45:40.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有意见吗
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.53,1:45:41.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.62,1:45:43.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带着一大堆秘密道具
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.78,1:45:46.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到我的房间去 乘坐时光机
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.32,1:45:49.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到过去 解开巨神像的秘密吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.82,1:26:25.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 你正在眺望远方  回想着昨天的种种 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.07,1:26:32.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 你所经历的  你所思考的 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.56,1:26:38.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 虽然我无从得知 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.90,1:26:51.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 但那沉重的行囊  就由我来为你分担吧 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.76,1:27:04.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 想一直和你做朋友  这无需任何约定吧 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.01,1:27:16.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 很想做你的朋友  无论雨天  还是晴天 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.84,1:29:39.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 在我心中一直描绘着一张图 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.56,1:29:41.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 描绘着 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.63,1:29:47.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 乘着梦想飞翔 在只属于自己的世界地图上 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.32,1:29:56.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 遨游天际穿越时空 无论多么遥远的国度 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.62,1:30:02.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 只要打开门立刻就能完成心愿 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.12,1:30:12.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.88,1:30:20.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.60,1:30:21.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.83,1:30:24.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.48,1:30:28.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.23,1:30:29.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.82,1:30:37.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.16,1:45:59.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 只要勇往直前伸出双手 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.41,1:46:02.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 光的讯号 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.96,1:46:08.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 就一定能够找到 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.65,1:46:32.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 背对着背  总是感到悲伤 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.15,1:46:36.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 不知道答案是什么 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.03,1:46:41.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 低头看着水洼 小声地说 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.41,1:46:43.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 你有好好地笑吗 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.41,1:46:46.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 你却什么也不说 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.08,1:46:50.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 在群星中 沿着地图寻找 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.80,1:46:54.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 虽然偶尔也会碰壁 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.76,1:46:57.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 但我不会再回头 现在 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.22,1:47:03.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 就迎向未来吧 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.89,1:47:08.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 抬头仰望 好蓝好蓝的天空的那头 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.90,1:47:13.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 崭新的明天 正等着我们 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.07,1:47:15.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 一点也不会害怕 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.40,1:47:19.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 梦想与希望 都收藏在口袋里 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.45,1:47:22.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 握紧拳头 来吧 大步往前走 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.83,1:47:26.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 闭上双眼 想像 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.46,1:47:31.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 在天空划过 光的讯号 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.05,1:47:33.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 去找出来吧 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.51,1:47:39.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 只有一种 属于自己的光芒 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.03,1:48:07.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 抬头仰望 好蓝好蓝的天空的那头 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.04,1:48:11.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 崭新的明天 正等着我们 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.21,1:48:13.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 一点也不会害怕 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.55,1:48:17.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 梦想与希望 都收藏在口袋里 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.59,1:48:21.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 握紧拳头 来吧大步往前走 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.69,1:49:11.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 觉得有趣吗
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.91,1:49:13.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.26,1:49:14.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.80,1:49:30.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,[敬请期待]
